          "heading": "State",
          "path": "C:\\Users\\klimp\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Paradox Interactive\\Hearts of Iron IV\\mod\\chaos_redux\\paradox_wiki\\Entity modding - Hearts of Iron 4 Wiki.md",
          "startLine": 124,
          "endLine": 138,
          "excerpt": "### State <a id=\"State\"></a> The state scope contains these attributes:",
          "authority": "Offline Paradox Wiki snapshot",
          "sectionStartLine": 124,
          "sectionEndLine": 138,
          "startColumn": 1,
          "text": "### State <a id=\"State\"></a>\n\nThe state scope contains these attributes:\n\n- **name** is the name of the state that a model may enter. All models have an **idle** state.\n- **state_time** is the duration of the current state.\n- **looping** determines whether this state loops or not.\n- **event** is a scope that applies a particle or sound effect.\n- **animation** is the animation state (from the pdxmesh) to play.\n- **animation_blend_time** is the blend time between the current and the specified animation.\n- **animation_speed** is the playback speed of the animation.\n- **next_state** sets the next state for the current state.\n- **chance** determines the chance of this state entry occuring if it shares its name with multiple other state entries (i.e. training, whether to pushup, jumping jack, etc.)\n- **propagate_state** propagates the current state to the specified node.\n",
          "nextLine": null,
          "nextColumn": null
        }
      }
    }
  },
